==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|sinus|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsaɪnəs/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|aɪnəs}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|sinuses}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} A pouch or cavity in any organ or tissue, especially the [[paranasal sinus]].
# {{context|pathology|lang=en}} An abnormal cavity or passage such as a [[fistula]], caused by the destruction of tissue.

====Derived terms====
